<title>THAILAND: TABLE-ADVANCED INFO Q2 NET PROFIT HIGHER.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ADVANCED INFO Q2 NET PROFIT HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     3.97	 vs	     3.79</p>
<p>    Net		    927.97	 vs	   886.24</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     7.85			  7.63</p>
<p>    Net		  1,836.35		    1,784.73</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is Advanced Info Service Plc, a mobile phone operator.</p>
